Thumbs.db

# BuildKit credential staging file (dependency-resolution.md §6). The canonical
# Gitea module-credential pattern mounts these variables via
# --mount=type=secret and the file is meant to live OUTSIDE the build context;
# this line is the second line of defence, so that a copy landing in the tree
# by accident can never be baked into a layer by a broad COPY.
gomodauth*
